  "selection": "At each pinned commit: root LICENSE*, NOTICE* and COPYING* files, and every file under licenses/ except licenses/bindings/ (Java and Python binding dependencies) and licenses/perf/ (profiling tools), neither of which ships in the JavaScript packages pinned here. Hashes are SHA-256 of the raw blob bytes.",
  "commands": [
   "gh api repos/tursodatabase/<repository>/commits/<tag> --jq .sha",
   "gh api 'repos/tursodatabase/<repository>/git/trees/<commit>?recursive=1' --jq '.tree[] | select(.type==\"blob\") | .path'",
   "gh api 'repos/tursodatabase/<repository>/contents/<path>?ref=<commit>' -H 'Accept: application/vnd.github.raw' | sha256sum"
  ],
  "limits": [
   "The Rust dependency graph compiled into each native binding was not audited against licenses/core and licenses/extensions; the selection takes the upstream's own notice set as given.",
