   "NOTICE.md at turso v0.8.2 gives Error Prone the path licenses/bindings/java/assertj-license.md and AssertJ the path licenses/bindings/java/errorprone-license.md.",
   "@tursodatabase/serverless 0.2.4 installs without a repository field. Its source is taken from the npm registry's gitHead, a commit in tursodatabase/turso titled 'serverless: 0.2.4' that v0.8.2 contains."
  ]
